2026-07-27T12:14:00.0712745Z i /tmp/Rtmp0188Cc/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:14:00.0713051Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:14:00.0713396Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:14:00.0713708Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:14:00.0714191Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:14:00.0714854Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:14:00.0715702Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
